# # /project-uricoechea/
#
# Permanent identifiers for the linked data of the Uricoechea pilot digital
# edition of the Instituto Caro y Cuervo.
#
# - https://w3id.org/project-uricoechea/data/ is the base of the addresses of the
#   resources (documents, pages, lines, lexicon entries). The data is not
#   published yet: until it is, everything under it redirects to a page that says so.
# - https://w3id.org/project-uricoechea/vocab/1.0 is the namespace of the vocabulary of
#   the project, version 1.0; its terms are written vocab/1.0#term.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Juan Manuel Espinosa Restrepo
# GitHub username: juanmaespinosa

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^$ https://juanmaespinosa.github.io/project-uricoechea/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^vocab/1\.0$ https://juanmaespinosa.github.io/project-uricoechea/vocab/1.0/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^data/(.*)$ https://juanmaespinosa.github.io/project-uricoechea/data/ [R=302,L]
